      "content": "Hey, i'm working on a paper about that new novel \"The Glass Horizon\" that everyone's arguing about. I want to write an intro that looks at how the author uses the main characters to actually deconstruct the narrow-mindedness and the regressive logic of the opposing political faction. Can you help me draft an opening paragraph that sets that up?",
