      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>That sounds like a good start. To make it more punchy, can we lean harder into describing the \"opposing faction\"? I want the prose to show that their arguments aren't just different, but are actually intellectually dishonest and based on fear. Could you suggest some sophisticated ways to describe their mindset as being stuck in an outdated, reactionary loop?",
